Wrote coder-3.json with one row for the data-centers topic. HB 1007's operative text establishes an expedited commission review process with deemed-approval deadlines plus mandatory load-growth-forecast and ratepayer-protection disclosures, which I coded as chair-shaped evidence for rung 4 ("streamlined permitting... requiring transparency about projected energy demand and rate impacts"), excluding rungs 1/2/5 (not a moratorium, not an absolute cost-pass-through bar, not minimal barriers) and rung 3 (no community-benefit precondition, and the process is expedited/deemed-approved rather than a case-by-case gate).
